# 统一换行符：仓库内文本文件一律 LF（与 .editorconfig 的 end_of_line = lf 一致）
# 目的：Windows 克隆/提交时不再出现「整文件 diff」，PR 只显示真实改动。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不参与换行与文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text

# Office / 交付物 / 依赖压缩包
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
